  PASS  identity is exactly 1.0 at every lag
  PASS  blur reads deeply SMEARED at d=1 (< 0.5)
  PASS  blur signature RISES monotonically toward 1.0 as the lag outruns the kernel
  PASS  blur has essentially no effect by d=32 (|B1-1| < 0.15)

  ⇒ d=16 and d=32 are therefore a BUILT-IN NEGATIVE CONTROL: a sharpness change cannot
    move them. Movement there would be a scale/magnitude change, not sharpening.

